      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the last one. Clients should check <a href=\"Slice.html#hasNext()\"><code>Slice.hasNext()</code></a> before calling this method.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>以请求下一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是最后一个，则可以调用<a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"Slice.html#hasNext()\"><code>Slice.hasNext()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the previous <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the first one. Clients should check <a href=\"Slice.html#hasPrevious()\"><code>Slice.hasPrevious()</code></a> before calling this\nmethod.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>，用于请求前一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是第一个，则返回<a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"Slice.html#hasPrevious()\"><code>Slice.hasPrevious()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SliceImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SliceImpl</code></a> with the given content. This will result in the created <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> being\nidentical to the entire <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个包含给定内容的新的<a href=\"SliceImpl.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SliceImpl</code></a>。这将导致创建的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"接口 org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>与整个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.util\"><code>List</code></a>完全相同。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
